{[%csl Gf6][%cal Ge4f6,Ge1e8,Gf6e8] White to move and checkmate in one move!} 
1. Nf6# {[%cal Gf6e8,Ge1e8] Doublecheck and checkmate! White gives two checks
in the same time by the rook and the knight. Both pieces could be taken but
the other one keeps the king in check, therefore it is not possible. The only
escape would be the move out from the check with the king, but no squares are
available.} *

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
