{[%csl Gg6][%cal Ge5g6,Gb2h8]} 1. Ng6# {[%cal Gg6h8,Gb2h8] Doublecheck and
checkmate again! White gives two checks in the same time, which means that is
not possible to take any of the pieces despite they are hanging and the king
has no square to leave. Doublecheck is a very strong weapon in chess. We
always need to pay attention for such possibilities. In this chapter you need
to deliver checkmates with the help of a doublecheck.} *

